{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start and Manage Your Own Second-Hand Game Store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this immersive first-person simulation game, you'll strive to become the owner of the best second-hand game store around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a small but exciting start:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy products, place them on shelves, and organize your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with customers, sell them games, and try to buy their items at the best prices. Haggle smartly to boost your profits and grow your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not just about selling \u2014 customize your store\u2019s interior to make it more stylish and appealing. The better your shop looks, the more customers you'll attract!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don\u2019t forget... it\u2019s not all work! After a long day, hit the bar, unwind, and enjoy your\u00a0social\u00a0life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667730?t=1772791111","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/40ce0e75bd5592644322c158f409600a923fc949/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772791111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/32960ab2eee9eae4025e27625db4e796ef3e3591/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772791111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/32960ab2eee9eae4025e27625db4e796ef3e3591/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772791111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3804700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start and Manage Your Own Second-Hand Game Store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this immersive first-person simulation game, you'll strive to become the owner of the best second-hand game store around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with a small but exciting start:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy products, place them on shelves, and organize your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with customers, sell them games, and try to buy their items at the best prices. Haggle smartly to boost your profits and grow your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not just about selling \u2014 customize your store\u2019s interior to make it more stylish and appealing. The better your shop looks, the more customers you'll attract!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don\u2019t forget... it\u2019s not all work! After a long day, hit the bar, unwind, and enjoy your\u00a0social\u00a0life.</p>","developers":["Bear Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667730/06b38ab75139ececbca8ac5e66d2935930344e82/header.jpg?t=1772791111","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3667730/1158034996/9f4c8b2e4097f5ac449ff69edcae96607f31e8a9/1769624552/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769625837","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3667730/1158034996/9f4c8b2e4097f5ac449ff69edcae96607f31e8a9/1769624552/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769625837","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3667730/1158034996/9f4c8b2e4097f5ac449ff69edcae96607f31e8a9/1769624552/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769625837","id":257274856,"name":"FullVersion","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257274856/1d87c5e13cc106f440508ac4972d5027c309724c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769625837"}],"name":"Console Store Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 6700k / RYZEN 5